      "number": 1,
      "arabicText": " إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muḥammad], al-Kawthar.",
      "footnotes": "",
