    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "arabicText": "فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ",
      "englishText": "So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/108002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.[2002]",
      "footnotes": "[2002] From all good in this world and the Hereafter.",
